// A regular file named augogen is not the plate directory.
// The read ignores it. An empty file is replaced with a directory on write.
// A file that still holds bytes stays.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE augfile ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG augfile law

IMPULSE augfile 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "augfile" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
